msgctxt "288"
msgid "(......)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "(......)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "(Still no customers...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "(Wait, somebody's coming.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "You the owner here? We're from Ashimoto Renovations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"We're based in the city, but we mainly renovate old buildings all over "
"Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "(Ashimoto Renovations? Where have I heard that name before?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"This building is pretty darn old. I'll bet it was built before "
"earthquake-proof construction was implemented."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"But what I'm really worried about is termites, 'cause those little "
"buggers'll eat away at the foundation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Mind if we take a look? It won't take long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "(Termites? I'm pretty sure this building's made of concrete...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Since you're here, be my guest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"That's a wise decision. You gotta nip these things in the bud before it's "
"too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Let's check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Uh-huh... This is pretty bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Those little bastards really tore up your foundation. Good thing we dropped "
"by when we did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "And what about your plumbing? You got any leaks? Bad pipes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "No, this place is made of concrete. Not exactly a delicacy for termites."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah!? Heh... Sorry about that, buddy. Guess we got our buildings mixed "
"up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "But what about your plumbing? You got any leaks? Bad pipes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "I think we better check out the plumbing to be on the safe side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "(I think the plumbing was just fixed.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Go right ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"Wise decision. Plumbing can really be a bitch 'cause it's hidden away, you "
"know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Let's check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Uh-huh... I knew it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Your water pipes are a disaster waiting to happen. But we can fix it right "
"up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "No thanks. We just had the plumbing fixed, so I'm sure it's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Oh, yeah? Well, if you say so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"But before we go, what's your smoke alarm situation? They're required by "
"law, you know. They were just talkin' about that on TV."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"You gotta pay a hefty fine if you don't got no smoke alarms. And a lot of "
"people have paid dearly when fires break out without warning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "(Smoke alarms? I'm pretty sure this place had 'em put in a long time ago.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Do what you need to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"Good choice, buddy. A lot of people really regret not puttin' 'em in after "
"their place burns up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "No need. I'm pretty sure this place had smoke alarms put in a while back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Oh, yeah? Well, I hope you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "Well, let's get down to business, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"We can start working right away, so if you could just sign here. We'll make "
"sure you get a good deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "(They want me to sign a contract?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "All right. Do what you need to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Thank you! We'll be done before you know it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "That'll do here! Everything's up to snuff now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "That was fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "In this business, we gotta be fast, buddy. Anyway, here's the bill..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Make sure you pay on time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "(Those guys were sure in a hurry.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Oh, there you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "I'm back. Were those men customers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Not exactly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "You know, I was just talking to a restaurant owner nearby..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid ""
"He was telling me there are a lot of renovation scams going around lately. "
"People asking about termites, smoke alarms, and such."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid ""
"Those men on their way out had coveralls on, so I thought they might be a "
"couple of phony renovators."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "Hmm? What's that paper? A bill...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "You're not gonna like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid ""
"It's from... Ashimoto Renovations!? That's the company conning people out "
"of money!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I thought I could trust you to watch over the place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "Termite extermination... 200,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "Plumbing repairs... 200,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid "Smoke alarm installation... 200,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Why on earth did you sign this!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid "Sorry, I fell for it big time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid ""
"What am I gonna do? I guess I can cover this, but I've got a new rent "
"contract due next month and all sorts of other expenses..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid "It's my fault. I'll pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296"
msgid ""
"What? But I'm the one who asked you to watch the place. Besides, I "
"certainly can't let you pay for things for my bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1308"
msgid "No, I'll pay. No ifs, ands, or buts about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320"
msgid "Let me do this, Mariko."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1332"
msgid "All right, how about we go fifty-fifty? Does that sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1344"
msgid "It's a deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid "(Ouch... That's a big chunk of change.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
msgid "(Ouch... That's a big chunk of change.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid "(Ouch... That's a big chunk of change.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1440"
msgid "(Dammit... Looks like I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1452"
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464"
msgid "Well... Seems I'm a little low on cash..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1476"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about it. Look, if you really feel the need to pay, just give "
"whatever you can now, and that'll be the end of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1488"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1500"
msgid ""
"Sorry I forced you to watch over the place like that. This never would've "
"happened if I'd been smart enough to keep the place stocked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1512"
msgid ""
"No, I'm the one to blame here. Those bastards really pulled the wool over "
"my eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1536"
msgid "You got 500 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1584"
msgid ""
"Sorry I forced you to watch over the place like that. This never would've "
"happened if I'd been smart enough to keep the place stocked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1596"
msgid ""
"No, I'm the one to blame here. Those bastards really pulled the wool over "
"my eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620"
msgid "You got 1,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1668"
msgid ""
"Sorry I forced you to watch over the place like that. This never would've "
"happened if I'd been smart enough to keep the place stocked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1680"
msgid ""
"No, I'm the one to blame here. Those bastards really pulled the wool over "
"my eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1752"
msgid "That's enough. This place is fine, so get out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1764"
msgid ""
"What the hell is your problem? We were nice enough to come down here and "
"help, and now you try to chase us out!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776"
msgid "Maybe we oughta teach you some manners, pops!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1788"
msgid "I'm dying to learn some. Let's take it outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1812"
msgid "I'm not signing this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1824"
msgid "Not signing!? After all the fuckin' examination you made us do!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1836"
msgid ""
"Maybe this guy needs a little incentive to help him sign! Like a few broken "
"ribs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1848"
msgid "Fine. Let's see what you've got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1872"
msgid "I don't think so. Get outta here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1884"
msgid ""
"What the hell is your problem? We were nice enough to come down here and "
"help, and now you try to chase us out!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1896"
msgid ""
"Sounds to me like you need a little attitude adjustment. Termites are "
"nothin' compared to what we're gonna do to this place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1908"
msgid "All right. We'll continue this conversation outside."
msgstr ""

